  "summary_en": "Voluntary guidelines from Singapore's Cyber Security Agency for system owners on securing AI systems across the lifecycle (planning, development, deployment, operations, end of life). Starts from risk assessment, covers adversarial ML threats and classical cyber risks, and excludes AI safety, fairness and AI-enabled attacks.",
